"🐢 hold up dude...

🐚 git.branch.rebase begin
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: --unstaged include cannot apply to a rebase
      ├─ why: a rebase replays commits; it has no commit of its own to fold edits into
      └─ files
         ├─ settings.of.grove.json
         └─ settings.of.repo.json

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ set them aside for the rebase, each put back after; or, only if every path above belongs in a commit, commit them first
   ├─ rhx git.branch.rebase begin --mode apply --unstaged ignore
   └─ rhx git.commit.set -m @stdin --unstaged include --mode apply
"
`;

