🐚 git.branch.rebase abort
   ├─ what
   │  ├─ abort a rebase and restore to pre-rebase state
   │  └─ with no rebase in progress, puts back any paths still set aside
   ├─ usage
   │  └─ rhx git.branch.rebase abort [--unstaged ignore]
   ├─ args
   │  └─ --unstaged ignore    set a fresh unstaged edit aside too; put back after
   └─ examples
      ├─ rhx git.branch.rebase abort
      └─ rhx git.branch.rebase abort --unstaged ignore
"
`;

